{"sha": "968935148923f66d3dc71d71f06cc73e5c013eb42768f16ad40e442ba326b57e", "body": ["\\textbf{3.} $m = 9.0 \\times 0.500 = \\qty{4.5}{g}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} 是的：溶液中每升约含 \\qty{9}{g}，饱和时每千克水可溶解", "\\qty{360}{g}，溶液浓度约低四十倍。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 共需盐 $9.0 \\times 1.0 = \\qty{9.0}{g}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $M(\\ce{NaCl}) = 23.0 + 35.5 = \\qty{58.5}{g/mol}$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} $c = 9.0 / 58.5 = \\qty{0.154}{mol/L}$.", "", "\\textbf{8.} $n = 0.154 \\times 0.500 = \\qty{0.0769}{mol}$（或", "$4.5 / 58.5$）。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 每个 \\ce{NaCl} 电离出一个 \\ce{Na+} 和一个 \\ce{Cl-}，二者浓度均为", "\\qty{0.154}{mol/L}。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $0.0769 \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{4.63e22}$ 个钠离子。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $F = 200 / 9.0 = 22.2$.", "", "\\textbf{12.} 袋中的 \\qty{4.5}{g} 全部取自浓", "溶液：$V_0 = \\qty{4.5}{g} / \\qty{200}{g/L} = \\qty{0.0225}{L} =", "\\qty{22.5}{mL}$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $V_0 = V_1 / F = 500 / 22.2 = \\qty{22.5}{mL}$.", "", "\\textbf{14.} $c_0 = 200 / 58.5 = \\qty{3.42}{mol/L}$;", "$c_0 V_0 = 3.42 \\times 0.0225 = \\qty{0.0769}{mol}$ 与", "$c_1 V_1 = 0.154 \\times 0.500 = \\qty{0.0769}{mol}$：相等。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 约加无菌水 $500 - 22.5 = \\qty{478}{mL}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 用 \\qty{25}{mL} 的刻度移液管（或滴定管），", "读数精确至 \\qty{0.1}{mL}。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 用 \\qty{500.0}{mL} 容量瓶配制，定容至刻度线。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $C_m = 200 \\times 23.0 / 500 = \\qty{9.20}{g/L}$，偏浓", "约 $0.20 / 9.0 \\approx \\qty{2.2}{\\percent}$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 取 \\qty{22.5}{mL} 的浓（“20 \\%”）溶液，", "用于配制一袋 \\qty{500}{mL} 的溶液。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}